<title>USA: Cobre CSD 2, N.M., won by Principal Financial.</title>
<headline>Cobre CSD 2, N.M., won by Principal Financial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Principal Financial Securities said it won $5 million of Cobre CSD 2, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, Series Feb. 15, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.31 percent.</p>
</text>
